     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Juan,<div>Not sure where your issue lies, but if you do the following, you should be able to upload your application pretty easily hopefully.</div><div><br></div><div>- Go to the directory that contains your .rmd file</div>\r\n\r\n<div>- run:  shinyapps::deployApp()</div><div><br></div><div>The directory you are in will be sent up to the server and if you only have that one app in the directory it should open a browser window right to it.</div><div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>-Tareef</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
